        "dream_name": "Golden Tide",
        "story_prompt": "A ridiculously pampered corgi, blissfully napping on a tropical island, unwittingly becomes the object of fervent worship by a band of quirky pirates.",
        "initial_goal": "To experience the absurdity of being a divine figure without fully understanding the situation.",
        "pitch": "Imagine a vibrant, sun-drenched tropical island. Palm trees sway, turquoise water laps the shore, and right in the middle of it all, a corgi \u2013 a gloriously fluffy, undeniably adorable corgi \u2013 is sound asleep. Unbeknownst to him, this island is inhabited by a group of delightfully eccentric pirates, who believe he's a deity sent to bring them prosperity. They build him a miniature golden palace, offer him tropical fruit sacrifices (which he mostly ignores), and dance around him in elaborate, slightly off-key rituals. The film is a whimsical, largely silent comedy; we see the world through the corgi\u2019s perspective \u2013 lazy blinks, occasional ear twitches, and the vague sense that something unusual is happening. The visual style is bright, saturated, and slightly surreal \u2013 think Wes Anderson meets Moana, but with a corgi as the centerpiece. The soundtrack will be a playful mix of ukulele music, pirate shanties, and the occasional contented snore. Ultimately, it's a celebration of absurdity, reminding us not to take ourselves too seriously, and highlighting the joy of simple pleasures...like a good nap in the sun.",
